  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activities directed towards refugees, IDPs and returnees, with specific needs, such as female-headed households, children and elderly. Needs include physical and legal security to access basic services, including food, non-food items, shelter, water health, education and durable solutions.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till utsatta flyktingar, interflyktingar och &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande med speciella behov inklusive kvinnoledda hush&#xe5;ll, barn och &#xe4;ldre. I behoven ing&#xe5;r bl.a. fysisk och legal s&#xe4;kerhet genom tillg&#xe5;ng till bas-service, inklusive livsmedel, icke-livsmedel,skydd, vatten, h&#xe4;lsa, utbildning och l&#xe5;ngsiktiga l&#xf6;sningar.</narrative>
  </description>
